exports[`every purpose, from the example record > appointment-brief 1`] = `
"Appointment brief
A short brief to help at a health appointment: how things are now, treatment and recent appointments.
Sam Taylor
Example: fall at work (made up)
1 June 2026
Current position
Areas of daily life affected
Preparing food, Using the toilet, Dressing and undressing, Mixing with other people
Medication
Naproxen
Recent treatment
Physiotherapy, Operation to fix the wrist with a plate
Last appointment
17 April 2026, Fracture clinic, Leeds General Infirmary
Next appointment
4 June 2026, Physiotherapy, St James’s
How it affects me
Preparing food
How it is
It is harder now
What happens
I can’t chop or lift a full pan. I mostly use ready meals.
Help I need
Someone to lift pans and drain vegetables.
How often
Every day
Using the toilet
How it is
It is harder now
What happens
Cleaning myself with my left hand is difficult and slow.
How often
Every day
Dressing and undressing
How it is
I find this very difficult
What happens
I can’t do buttons or zips with my right hand. My partner helps me every morning.
Help I need
Someone to help with buttons, zips and socks.
Aids or equipment
A sock aid and elastic shoelaces.
How often
Every day
Doing it safely, and more than once
I lose my balance putting trousers on, so I sit down.
The time it takes
About twice as long as before.
Doing it properly, to a good standard
I often have to leave shirts undone.
Mixing with other people
How it is
It is harder now
What happens
I avoid busy places because I worry someone will knock my arm.
How often
Most days
Anything else this has changed
I had to stop playing five-a-side football, which was my main way of seeing friends.
Recent changes
Health and wellbeing check-ins
2 April 2026
Pain
High
How I felt
Struggling
Pulse
82 beats per minute
Bad night after physio.
12 May 2026
