How it is
It is harder now
What happens
Cleaning myself with my left hand is difficult and slow.
How often
Every day
Dressing and undressing
How it is
I find this very difficult
What happens
I can’t do buttons or zips with my right hand. My partner helps me every morning.
Help I need
Someone to help with buttons, zips and socks.
Aids or equipment
A sock aid and elastic shoelaces.
